OL,3,GNEWSASignalman retires after 38 years
OL,4,Aat Britain's most unusual rail bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FMick, now 65, is stepping down from
OL,7,FKeadby Canal signal box, which controls
OL,8,Frail, canal and foot traffic navigating
OL,9,Fthe rare, moving structure.
